                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "RAUC has no cancel: its daemon keeps writing the inactive slot after the helper that asked for the install is killed (the app crashed or restarted past the download). When the app comes back and RAUC still reports the install, the status panel's own state is Installing: the attempt's version, one plain sentence, and no actions. It is not dimmed, because it is the live state; Check, Load from USB and the channel hold off, and Restart and Shut down are refused with Wait for the update."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "28",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
            "textDecoration": "none",
            "letterSpacing": "0",
            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
          {
            "lineHeight": "1.2",
            "fontStyle": "normal",
            "children": [
