            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
          {
            "lineHeight": "1.2",
            "fontStyle": "normal",
            "children": [
              {
                "lineHeight": "1.2",
                "fontStyle": "normal",
                "textTransform": "none",
                "textAlign": "left",
                "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
                "fontSize": "28",
                "fontWeight": "400",
                "textDirection": "ltr",
                "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
                "textDecoration": "none",
                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "When RAUC goes idle the helper reads what it left. Every inactive slot \"ok\" for the attempt's version, written after the attempt began and in the same boot: the helper stages it, and the panel moves to Ready to install with the encoder on Install and restart. Anything else stays Update paused, as before. Restart also stages such an install before it reboots, so the restart tries it."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
